  <button onclick="prevStep()">◀</button>
  <span id="stepLabel" style="font-size:11px;min-width:64px;text-align:center"></span>
  <button onclick="nextStep()">▶</button>
</span>
<label>Case
  <select id="caseToggleInput" onchange="toggle_caseToggle(this.value)" style="font-size:11px;padding:2px">
    <option>(a) left turn — push</option>
    <option>(b) nonleft turn — pop</option>
    <option>both panels</option>
  </select>
</label>
<span style="display:flex;gap:6px;align-items:center">
  <button onclick="trigger_scanStep()">Step the scan ▸</button>
  <button onclick="trigger_resetScan()">Reset</button>
</span>
<span style="font-size:11px">scan state: <b id="scanStateOut">start</b></span>
<span id="stackOut" style="font-size:10px;color:#444;font-family:ui-monospace,Consolas,monospace;line-height:1.5"></span>
<span style="display:block;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;margin-top:2px">Legend</span>
<span style="font-size:11px"><span style="display:inline-block;width:16px;height:5px;background:#bdbdbd;vertical-align:middle"></span> hull boundary</span>
<span style="font-size:11px"><span style="display:inline-block;width:14px;height:10px;background:#dcdcdc;vertical-align:middle"></span> hull so far (<i>Q</i><sub>j</sub>)</span>
<span style="font-size:11px"><span style="display:inline-block;width:14px;height:10px;background:#b3b3b3;vertical-align:middle"></span> candidate region annexed</span>
<span style="font-size:11px"><span style="display:inline-block;width:11px;height:11px;border-radius:50%;background:#fff;border:2px solid #e8790c;vertical-align:middle"></span> point / turn under test</span>
<span style="font-size:11px"><span style="display:inline-block;width:11px;height:11px;border-radius:50%;background:#fff;border:2px solid #c0392b;vertical-align:middle"></span> popped (interior) point</span>
<button onclick="showPopup('Key insight','A nonleft turn is not just a bookkeeping rule — it is geometric proof that the middle point lies strictly inside a triangle formed by three other hull points, so it can never be a vertex of the convex hull.')" style="margin-top:2px">Why does a nonleft turn pop?</button>
<span style="font-size:10px;color:#666">Click p<sub>i</sub>, p<sub>j</sub>, p<sub>r</sub> or p<sub>t</sub> in the figure to see the triangle that certifies its status.</span>
